			"Message": "chore(Wind): Regenerate service and command catalogs with updated timestamps\n\nThe CommandCatalog and ServiceCatalog version dates have been updated from \"2026-05-24\" to \"2026-05-25\" as part of the daily contract refresh. The ITerminalSandboxServiceUpstream interface was updated to include new optional parameters and modified JSDoc comments for all methods to accept a precheckInputs parameter. The tsconfig.tsbuildinfo was also updated to reflect the latest incremental build changes.\n\nThis update synchronizes the interface definitions and maintains consistency with the daily code generation pipeline.",
