			"Message": "chore(Wind): Regenerate tsconfig.tsbuildinfo to update build metadata\n\nThe `tsconfig.tsbuildinfo` file was updated as part of the incremental build pipeline, reflecting changes in module resolution. The build metadata file was regenerated after composite TypeScript project updates, ensuring that the incremental build system maintains up-to-date type definitions and project structure consistency.\n\nThis change impacts build optimization and development workflow, with no effect on the public API.",
